{
  "slug": "pixeltable",
  "name": "Pixeltable",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build multimodal AI applications with Pixeltable -- tables, computed columns, embedding search, UDFs, tool-calling agents, and 25+ AI provider integrations.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **2 agents**, **2 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `pixeltable-skill` (Build multimodal AI apps with Pixeltable)\n- **Agents** (2): `pixeltable-debugger` (Diagnoses failing or stale Pixeltable pipelines), `pixeltable-pipeline-architect` (Designs Pixeltable TableModel schemas)\n- **Commands** (2): `add-provider` (Add an AI provider call as a Pixeltable computed column (correct import + output shape)), `scaffold` (Start a Pixeltable project with pxt init and a CLI example file)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pixeltable@claude-plugins-official` from `pixeltable/pixeltable-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
